I arrive at the office.
It is a big software company.
I greet my colleagues.
"Good morning, Maya," they say.
"Good morning," I reply with a smile.
I walk over to my desk and sit down.
I turn on my computer.
I work as a software engineer.
At work, I write a lot of code.
I also test new programs all morning.
I concentrate on the tasks.
I really like my job.
I am very happy to be here.
